{"text": "SetTheExpectati gn\n\n\u2018THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT SAN ANTONIO\n\nMINIMUM EXPECTATIONS FOR DUE DILIGENCE INQUIRIES - TRANSFERS\n\n\u2018The University of Texas at San Antonio (\u201cUTSA\u201d) is required to use due diligence to gather pertinent\ninformation regarding the prior conduct of any current or prospective student-athlete, including a graduate\nstudent, who seeks to enroll and participate in intercollegiate athletics at UTSA.\n\nAta minimum, each current and prospective student-athlete is required to answer the following questions\nprior to the student-athlete practicing, competing, or receiving institutional financial aid:\n\n1. Do you have any criminal or juvenile delinquency charges pending against you? Yes No\n2. Do you have any civil lawsuits pending against you? Yes No\n\n3. Have you been convicted of, pleaded guilty to, pleaded no contest or been found a delinquent to\nany crime or delinquency involving:\n\na. Sexual Violence? Yes No\nb. Rape? Yes No\n\u00a2. Sexual Assault? Yes No\n4. Domestic Violence? Yes No\n\u20ac. Dating Violence? Yes No\nf. Stalking? Yes No\ng. Sexual Exploitation? Yes No\nhh. Sexual Harassment? Yes No\ni, Incest? Yes No\nj. Hate Crimes? Yes No\nk, Assault with a Deadly Weapon? Yes No\n1. Assault that eaused Serious Bodily Injury? Yes No\nm, Murder? Yes No\nn, Manslaughter? Yes No\n\n4. Have you ever been named a suspect in a law enforcement investigation involving:\n\na. Sexual Violence? Yes No\nb. Rape? Yes No\n\u00a2. Sexual Assault? Yes No\n4d. Domestic Violence? Yes No\ne. Dating Violence? Yes No\nf Stalking? Yes No\ng. Sexual Exploitation? Yes No\nhh, Sexual Harassment? Yes No\ni Yes No\ni es? Yes No\nKk, Assault with a Deadly Weapon? Yes No\n1. Assault that caused Serious Bodily Injury? Yes No\nm, Murder? Yes No\nn, Manslaughter? Yes No\n\nPage 1 of 3",
